#!args --page form --verify-dirty
# images the app supplies (--page form, MI_ASK): the view asks for the http(s) addresses of the
# images in view, each once ("Bilder: ..."); until the bytes come a frame with the alt text
# stands in (at the width / height the HTML gives); "Bilder liefern" answers -- two pictures
# (an SVG, a PNG: the block is laid out again at their sizes), one failure (the alt text stays)
# -- the image from app:// is read as before
size 1000 720
theme light
expect text:"Bilder: http://example.org/logo.svg, https://example.org/raster.png, https://example.org/fehlt.png" exists
expect image:"Logo aus dem Netz" rect 29 597 96 48
expect image:"Logo lokal" rect 388 621 48 24
click 600,330
key end
shot build/mdviewtest/images_wait.png
click "Bilder liefern"
expect image:"Logo aus dem Netz" rect * * 96 48
expect image:"Raster aus dem Netz" rect * * 64 40
expect image:"Fehlt" rect * * 47 28
expect image:"Logo lokal" rect * * 48 24
shot build/mdviewtest/images_done.png
theme dark
shot build/mdviewtest/images_done_dark.png
theme light
click "Bilder liefern"
expect text:"Bilder: http://example.org/logo.svg, https://example.org/raster.png, https://example.org/fehlt.png" exists
expect_nowarn
